+# TUI Fleet Scope Navigator
+
+The fleet bar is a scope selector, not a cache-sharing boundary.
+
+Default scope is `ALL`. Dashed repo names are automatically grouped by prefix:
+
+```text
+veox-shared + veox-deploy + veox-nht => veox-*
+```
+
+Keyboard:
+
+- `←/→` or `h/l`: move across visible scope items.
+- `Enter` on a family: drill into that family.
+- `Enter` on a repo: open repo details.
+- `Esc`: close detail, ascend from family, then reset to ALL.
+
+Filter semantics:
+
+- `ALL` includes all fleet data.
+- `Family { family }` includes only repos whose alias or slug tail belongs to that dashed prefix.
+- `Only { alias, slug }` includes only one repo.
+
+Cache/data isolation:
+
+- Families are only viewing scopes.
+- Caches must remain isolated per repo namespace.
+- Do not derive cache namespace from the family name alone.
